  message: "FOLDED into INV-nihaz as a duplicate. I filed this today without grepping the tracker first, which is rule 1 of the project operating rules; INV-nihaz has carried the same mechanism, the same ls-remote evidence and the same governance-approval request since 2026-08-27, and WI-sahih filed it a third time on 2026-09-02.\n\nNothing is lost by the fold: the two facts this filing added -- the updated 726-note count, and the pinpointed swallow at scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh:2116-2117 (`2>/dev/null || true`, which makes even a FIXED hook fail silently next time) -- are carried onto INV-nihaz. Invariants have no wont_do, so this is a duplicate_of link rather than a close."  # bda1
